  "answer_text": "Here's some information about **\"Still in Love with You\"** by **Brooks & Dunn**:\n\n- **\"Still in Love with You\"** is the tenth track on Brooks & Dunn's album *Brand New Man*.\n\n- The song was released in **1991**.\n\n- It was written and composed by **Don Cook, Kix Brooks, and Ronnie Dunn**, and the song runs **3 minutes and 34 seconds**.\n\n- The song has a classic country feel, telling the story of someone leaving a relationship but unable to shake their feelings \u2014 no matter what they do, they keep waking up still in love.\n\n> **Note:** I'm unable to reproduce the full song lyrics here due to copyright, but you can find them on licensed lyrics sites or listen to the song on [Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/track/5nTh5z1Uac2istxVmX3qH8) or [YouTube](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Iyk_dM9CbUY). \ud83c\udfb6",
